          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abandi beeyunga khuye, nibasuubila; mulala khubo yali Dionisio, omuAreopago, nende omukhasi oulangwa mbu Damari, nabandi khandi ninaho halala.",
          "type": "text",
